# Bot1's Flickerwisp targets Bot2's Mountain. Bot2 taps the Mountain for mana and Lightning Bolts the Flickerwisp in response. The
# enters trigger is independent of its source: the Mountain is exiled all the same, and comes back untapped at the beginning
# of the next end step (a new object, CR 400.7).

